  "Question": "Point A is rotated clockwise through \\(90^\\circ\\) about O to obtain A′. What is the relationship between OA and OA′?",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "\\(OA=OA'\\), and \\(\\angle AOA'=180^\\circ\\)",
    "B": "\\(OA\\parallel OA'\\), and \\(OA=OA'\\)",
    "C": "\\(OA=OA'\\), and \\(\\angle AOA'=90^\\circ\\)"
