  "Correct Answer": "C",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Under a rotation, corresponding points are at equal distances from the center of rotation, so \\(OA=OA'\\). The angle between the segments joining corresponding points to the center equals the angle of rotation, so \\(\\angle AOA'=90^\\circ\\).",
